### Description

In `cfgmgr/stpmgrd.cpp:26`, `fopen()` is called to check if a debug reload file exists, but the returned `FILE*` is never closed.

### Current code
```cpp
if (fopen("/stpmgrd_dbg_reload", "r")) {
    Logger::setMinPrio(Logger::SWSS_DEBUG);
}
// FILE* leaked
```

### Fix
```cpp
FILE *f = fopen("/stpmgrd_dbg_reload", "r");
if (f) {
    Logger::setMinPrio(Logger::SWSS_DEBUG);
    fclose(f);
}
```

### Impact
File descriptor leak every time `stpmgrd` starts.
